On node we will have kubectl first then  contoller run time interface
kubelet is aagent  responsible for make sure all container run as expected 
container runtime interface - we have 2 cri ie contollerd and cri-o it will resposible for run containner.

We can also run the docker conatiner in kubernetes , how node will be is it will have kubelet then cri then cri-dockerd->containerd->runc. So when we are running the doicker container in kubernetes in recent or modern kubernest ignore the  cri-dockerd and directly run containerd as kubernets also have containerd. Thats why now kubernetes is not suing docker.

